255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 175 0 R
/E ( E-commerce data is highly tabular and categorical \(brands, categories, strings\). Deep learning struggles with small tabular datasets. CatBoost is specifically designed for categorical data without requiring manual one-hot encoding, and it handles missing values \(NaNs\) natively. It is incredibly fast at both training and inference.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
