/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 184 0 R
/T (When the user searches, the system just looks at that physical spot in the vector space and grabs everything nearby.)
/E (When the user searches, the system just looks at that physical spot in the vector space and grabs everything nearby.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
