/P 184 0 R
/T (Conclusion: We chose this method because human language is messy. People use synonyms, slang, and descriptions instead of exact product names. Semantic search is the only way to understand what the user means, not just what they typed.)
/E (Conclusion: We chose this method because human language is messy. People use synonyms, slang, and descriptions instead of exact product names. Semantic search is the only way to understand what the user means, not just what they typed.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [6]
>>
